    "body": "I'd like to look at https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12011 in this meeting, as we've proposed stage 2 last year. We'd like HTML folks to look, but also want to give CSS folks a heads up as well since it contains non-trivial UA style sheet additions for our new elements, similar to customizable select.",
